Credits

The classic force mode, its seeded generator and its reference test copy
follow particle-life by Hunar Ahmad, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2022 Hunar
Ahmad — https://github.com/hunar4321/particle-life

Per-pair radii and word seeds are ideas from smarticles by Chevy Ray
Johnston, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2022 Chevy Ray Johnston —
https://github.com/ChevyRay/smarticles (no code copied).

The cell force follows the rule popularised by Tom Mohr's particle-life.
